                                                "sense_id": "d05d5121-1a6a-36d3-adcb-1facdb675a9e",
                                                "text": "Because unusual facades catch the public’s eye and generate much of the popular interest in contemporary architecture, clients often urge an architect to build something that looks unbuildable."
